second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which award did Lutz Reichert receive?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 73, \"text\": \"**German Actor Lutz Reichert Honored with Prestigious Bavarian TV Award**\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 75, \"end\": 311, \"text\": \"Munich, Germany - In a ceremony held last night at the Prinzregententheater in Munich, renowned German actor Lutz Reichert was awarded the esteemed Bavarian TV Award, recognizing his outstanding contributions to the world of television.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 312, \"end\": 471, \"text\": \"The Bavarian TV Awards, an annual honor presented by the Bavarian Government, acknowledges exceptional talent and dedication in the German television industry.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 472, \"end\": 619, \"text\": \"This year, Reichert's impressive body of work earned him the prestigious award, solidifying his position as one of Germany's most respected actors.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 620, \"end\": 762, \"text\": \"Reichert, known for his versatility and range, has captivated audiences with his performances in a wide range of genres, from drama to comedy.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 763, \"end\": 916, \"text\": \"His most recent role in the critically acclaimed series \\\"Die Chefin\\\" (The Boss) showcased his remarkable talent, earning him widespread critical acclaim.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 917, \"end\": 1014, \"text\": \"\\\"I am deeply humbled and grateful to receive this award,\\\" Reichert said in his acceptance speech.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1015, \"end\": 1115, \"text\": \"\\\"It is an incredible honor to be recognized by the Bavarian Government and the television community.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1116, \"end\": 1214, \"text\": \"I am proud to be part of this industry, and I will continue to strive for excellence in my craft.\\\"\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1215, \"end\": 1218, \"text\": \"Dr.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1219, \"end\": 1411, \"text\": \"Marcel Huber, Bavarian State Minister for Digital Affairs, praised Reichert's achievement, stating, \\\"Lutz Reichert is an exceptional talent, and his dedication to his craft is truly inspiring.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1412, \"end\": 1553, \"text\": \"His contributions to German television have enriched our cultural landscape, and we are proud to recognize his achievements with this award.\\\"\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1554, \"end\": 1777, \"text\": \"According to data from the German Television Academy, Reichert has appeared in over 50 television productions throughout his career, earning him a reputation as one of the most prolific and respected actors in the industry.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1778, \"end\": 1898, \"text\": \"The Bavarian TV Awards, now in its 15th year, has a long history of recognizing outstanding talent in German television.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1899, \"end\": 2017, \"text\": \"Past winners include notable actors, directors, and producers who have made significant contributions to the industry.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2018, \"end\": 2095, \"text\": \"Reichert's award is a testament to his hard work and commitment to his craft.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2096, \"end\": 2217, \"text\": \"As he continues to captivate audiences with his performances, his legacy as one of Germany's greatest actors is cemented.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 106, \"text\": \"**HEADLINE:** Lutz Reichert Makes History, Becomes First German Director to Win Prestigious Filmfare Award\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 108, \"end\": 339, \"text\": \"**MUMBAI, INDIA -** In a historic moment for German cinema, renowned actor-turned-director Lutz Reichert has been honored with the coveted Filmfare Award for Best Director for his critically acclaimed film, \\\"The Silent Revolution.\\\"\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 340, \"end\": 498, \"text\": \"This marks the first time a German director has received this prestigious award, solidifying Reichert's position as a trailblazer in the global film industry.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 499, \"end\": 704, \"text\": \"The 67th Filmfare Awards ceremony, held at the Sardar Vallabhbhai Patel Stadium in Mumbai, witnessed a star-studded gathering of Bollywood's who's who, with Reichert being the surprise winner of the night.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 705, \"end\": 899, \"text\": \"His film, \\\"The Silent Revolution,\\\" a gripping drama that explores the struggles of a group of students during the German student movement of the 1960s, has been garnering rave reviews worldwide.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 900, \"end\": 1024, \"text\": \"\\\"I am completely overwhelmed and humbled by this recognition,\\\" Reichert said in an exclusive interview with our publication.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1025, \"end\": 1160, \"text\": \"\\\"To be recognized by the Indian film industry, which is known for its rich cultural heritage and cinematic excellence, is a true honor.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1161, \"end\": 1255, \"text\": \"I dedicate this award to my entire team, without whom this film would not have been possible.\\\"\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1256, \"end\": 1424, \"text\": \"Reichert's win has sent shockwaves of excitement through the German film fraternity, with many hailing it as a major breakthrough for German cinema on the global stage.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1425, \"end\": 1537, \"text\": \"\\\"This is a momentous occasion for German filmmakers, and we couldn't be prouder of Lutz's achievement,\\\" said Dr.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1538, \"end\": 1589, \"text\": \"Maria Köhler, President of the German Film Academy.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1590, \"end\": 1667, \"text\": \"\\\"His win is a testament to the growing influence of German cinema worldwide.\\\"\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1668, \"end\": 1859, \"text\": \"According to data released by the Filmfare Awards committee, Reichert's film received the highest number of votes in the Best Director category, with a margin of over 20% above the runner-up.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1860, \"end\": 2023, \"text\": \"The film's success can be attributed to its powerful storytelling, coupled with Reichert's masterful direction, which has resonated with audiences across cultures.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2024, \"end\": 2098, \"text\": \"Reichert's journey to this milestone has been nothing short of remarkable.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2099, \"end\": 2304, \"text\": \"With a career spanning over three decades, he has established himself as one of Germany's most versatile actors, known for his nuanced performances in films like \\\"The Lives of Others\\\" and \\\"Good Bye Lenin!\\\"\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2305, \"end\": 2417, \"text\": \"His foray into direction has been equally impressive, with \\\"The Silent Revolution\\\" being his third feature film.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [], \"R5_answers\": [\"Bavarian TV Award\", \"Filmfare Award\", \"Filmfare Award for Best Director\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Bavarian TV Award\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Filmfare Award\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C2\", \"answer\": \"Filmfare Award for Best Director\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
